    n<// The recording macros assist users who implement the <uvm_object::do_record>> u<582> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<7502> s<583> f<958> l<25:1> el<25:79>
    n<// method. They help ensure that the fields are recorded using a vendor-> u<583> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<7502> s<584> f<958> l<26:1> el<26:73>
